WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.229 --> 00:00:14.256
Tina: rocks are blocking the path.

2
00:00:14.296 --> 00:00:17.339
Danny: There has to be a way past them.

3
00:00:17.359 --> 00:00:19.760
Brad: Let’s take a closer look.

4
00:00:22.723 --> 00:00:24.484
Brad: I don’t see an opening anywhere.

5
00:00:24.504 --> 00:00:27.766
Danny: I’m going to climb up and see what I can find.

6
00:00:27.786 --> 00:00:29.888
Tina: Be careful, Danny.

7
00:00:29.908 --> 00:00:33.202
Danny: Ouch, that hurt.

8
00:00:33.502 --> 00:00:36.685
Brad: Where’s your horse, Tina?

9
00:00:36.705 --> 00:00:38.906
Tina: Aw, look.

10
00:00:39.287 --> 00:00:40.208
She’s hungry.

11
00:00:40.228 --> 00:00:46.153
Brad: I’m glad your horse was hungry.

12
00:00:47.674 --> 00:00:49.115
I think she found an opening.

13
00:00:49.135 --> 00:00:51.257
Tina: Good girl!

14
00:00:51.517 --> 00:00:55.761
Brad: It looks dark in there.

15
00:00:55.781 --> 00:00:57.643
Danny: No problem.

16
00:01:00.268 --> 00:01:01.709
Danny: I think this will help.

17
00:01:01.729 --> 00:01:04.891
Tina: Good-bye and thank you.

18
00:01:04.911 --> 00:01:09.795
Danny: Okay, follow me!

19
00:01:09.815 --> 00:01:14.778
Danny: Stay close together, you guys.

20
00:01:14.798 --> 00:01:18.281
Brad: This is a really long tunnel.

21
00:01:18.301 --> 00:01:20.002
Danny: We’re almost there.

22
00:01:20.643 --> 00:01:22.364
I can see an opening up ahead.

23
00:01:33.184 --> 00:01:34.925
Brad: This isn’t going to be easy.

24
00:01:34.945 --> 00:01:37.686
Tina: We just need to be careful.

25
00:01:38.506 --> 00:01:40.107
Take one step at a time.

26
00:01:40.127 --> 00:01:44.249
Danny: It’s too dangerous.

27
00:01:44.269 --> 00:01:47.230
Brad: We’ve come this far, Danny.

28
00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:49.351
We can’t turn back now.

29
00:01:49.371 --> 00:01:50.591
Danny: I know.

30
00:01:50.611 --> 00:01:54.213
Tina: Hopian told you to use your imagination, right?

31
00:01:54.233 --> 00:01:55.953
Danny: That’s the problem.

32
00:01:56.694 --> 00:01:58.874
I can’t imagine climbing up this mountain!

33
00:01:58.894 --> 00:02:02.356
Tina: Close your eyes.

34
00:02:03.236 --> 00:02:05.178
Imagine yourself at the top.

35
00:02:05.878 --> 00:02:08.480
Tina: Imagine that you’ve made it there safely.

36
00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:10.161
Danny: Okay.

37
00:02:10.181 --> 00:02:13.143
Tina: Imagine us defeating Tristay.

38
00:02:13.544 --> 00:02:15.845
Imagine rescuing Hopian and Bello.

39
00:02:15.865 --> 00:02:17.506
Danny: Okay.

40
00:02:17.526 --> 00:02:21.029
Tina: Did you picture it clearly?

41
00:02:21.049 --> 00:02:22.450
Danny: Yes.

42
00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:24.291
Tina: Open your eyes.

43
00:02:25.332 --> 00:02:27.734
Everything you pictured is going to happen, Danny.

44
00:02:27.754 --> 00:02:30.496
Tina: You imagined it, so it will be true.

45
00:02:31.084 --> 00:02:34.725
Tina: We will make it up the mountain─one step at a time.

46
00:02:34.745 --> 00:02:35.705
I’ll lead.

47
00:02:35.725 --> 00:02:41.027
Tina: Be careful here.

48
00:02:41.047 --> 00:02:43.888
Brad: Whoa!

49
00:02:44.348 --> 00:02:45.328
That was close.

50
00:02:46.248 --> 00:02:47.068
Danny: Go slowly.

51
00:02:47.609 --> 00:02:49.169
Just take one step at a time.

52
00:02:49.209 --> 00:02:53.030
Tina: Why don’t we hold hands?

53
00:03:00.512 --> 00:03:01.955
Brad: You’re almost there, Danny.

54
00:03:01.975 --> 00:03:05.701
Danny: You were right, Tina.

55
00:03:06.503 --> 00:03:08.206
We just had to take one step
